{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id625259694?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"yimkc"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-17T18:25:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.11.0"}, "id":{"label":"13646053811"}, "title":{"label":"咁多間銀行, 渣打apps是最垃圾"}, "content":{"label":"個apps連最基本既月結單都開唔到, 搞咁多特效, 功能又唔多, 又成日lag, 客服既Q&A根本都幫唔到手, 好心正正經經搞番個銀行apps算啦", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id745653062?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"idhhdjbdsuw"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-17T01:55:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.11.0"}, "id":{"label":"13643137176"}, "title":{"label":"等10年都load唔到入去"}, "content":{"label":"開個Apps入完密碼，等成10幾分鐘都入唔到去，不停重開都係咁，最近經常性都係咁樣。\n呢個程式非常有問題，呢啲咁重要嘅程式可唔可以做好少少？", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id516735069?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"an real user"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-16T18:51:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.11.0"}, "id":{"label":"13642146812"}, "title":{"label":"Horrible App"}, "content":{"label":"I seldom write a review for an app but this is an exception. \n\nI tried to make a payment via app but it didn’t work and kept only showing “system 3000”. I stuck here for an hour. And i used to find solution from internet by myself and noted some ppl had the same issue 7 years ago. Apparently the app did not upgrade to resolve the issue. \n\nIn parallel, i left an online message to CS via app. When I come back to log in to read the reply from CS the day after, the app did not run smoothly (weird) and showed a long blanked message after a quite some time of waiting. The problem still cannot be fixed after multi-times re-logged in. Well, a new problem is created before the first problem is resolved.\n\nAnd this message is left when my second time to re-install the app within 24hr. Horrible!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
