{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id471712631?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"SK W."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-03T08:08:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.11.0"}, "id":{"label":"13590086894"}, "title":{"label":"SCB HK mobile app conflicting with VPN app"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using SCB HK mobile apps on my iPhone for 2+ years and noted its improvement and it is very handy to use. But recently I’ve found some login issue right after i have my VPN app (GlobalProtect) installed. After this installation, my SCB app has 100% of chance that will encounter an Authentication Failed in the following scenario:\n\n1. Launch SCB, login successful with faceID\n2. Logout\n3. Keep on the app and then choose login with faceID, authentication failed will happen!!\n\nif i wait and press try again, it will login successful. That’s weird.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
